  <item>
    <title>毕业后，你还是曾经的“屁大点事分享家”吗？Vol.13</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69e783891d989496e72d14ed</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69e783891d989496e72d14ed</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 21 Apr 2026 14:27:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><strong><span>🔖本期主题：</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><h2><span>时隔两年，我们带着全新状态回归啦！</span></h2><span></span><p><span>停更的两年里，我们经历了毕业、走进职场，有过忙到没精力发圈的时刻，也有突然就想找个人分享的瞬间，那些细碎的美好，哪怕只是默默记下来，也是一种治愈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我们围绕</span><em><strong><span>「分享欲」</span></strong></em><span>畅聊，既有日常碎碎念的真实感悟，也有关于自我成长的深度思考。你是热衷分享的人，还是习惯沉默的人呢？你的分享欲又是怎样变化的呢？愿我们都能找到属于自己的、舒服的分享节奏~</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl7oywYHJ1TMvZVEz0fmVTqe7YRn.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>⏰时间轴 Highlights</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="62">01:02</a> 久违的问候~ 聊聊毕业后断更这2年的经历</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a> 长大后，我不再是“屁大点事分享家”了</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="435">07:15</a> 我们的分享欲为何悄悄变少？分享欲被挤走了？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 因为</span><strong><span>美好</span></strong><span>，还会有分享欲爆棚的感受：古镇晚霞、东北春雪、陌生人的暖心时刻...</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="940">15:40</a> 我们的</span><strong><span>分享欲从何而来呢？</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1242">20:42</a> 关于”欲言又止”，很想说，但总是想想就算了</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1556">25:56</a> 其实勇敢分享的那些时刻，给我们带来了很多色彩</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1940">32:20</a> 分享的美好和不分享的平静，都值得被接纳。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2445">40:45</a> 我们在用播客重拾分享欲，好期待听到你们的分享~</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>快来评论区和我们聊聊，你最近最想分享的一件小事是什么？你又是 “分享浓人” 还是 “淡人” 呢？期待你的留言～</span></blockquote><span></span><p><em><span>底部会有我们想要分享的图片oh!</span></em></p><span></span><blockquote><span>💌</span><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong><span>：（听友群＋主播VX）</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>珍妮 vx:Aning_vx 公众号：珍妮的设计日记</span></p><span></span><p><span>海月西 vx:Haiyuexi_com 公众号：海月西的碎片收集站</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>📻</span><strong><span>收听方式：</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjtThN-zQ-OVKqXGtZS603cQJTWs.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>📮</span><strong><span>投稿方式</span></strong><span>：</span><a href="https://gokkbqydst.feishu.cn/base/ZFsVbCWBmaIJYKsqgQrcDxDtnvb?openFrom=workbench_feishu&amp;table=tblsDpUtkcivjhbP&amp;view=vewoiUIlNk&amp;larkForm=1" data-url="https://gokkbqydst.feishu.cn/base/ZFsVbCWBmaIJYKsqgQrcDxDtnvb?openFrom=workbench_feishu&amp;table=tblsDpUtkcivjhbP&amp;view=vewoiUIlNk&amp;larkForm=1"><span>云朵被窝留言箱</span></a></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>一些我们想分享的照片：</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftk4FJdCcd23jaV10RO7Wujhp_NO.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkOOBQyNgOH1h_IM7HfRY6BrwJCa.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrwEE9wFzyywR6zK8DLeXheF9_nq.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvbkQJi6NlV7ik4yoMmAMkR-tZuu.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
